    <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(79)90042-0> dct:title "Simple chemical reaction systems with limit cycle behaviour" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(81)90334-9> dct:title "A pre-pattern formation mechanism for animal coat markings" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1017/S0263593300006787> dct:title "The Devonian tetrapod Acanthostega gunnari Jarvik: postcranial anatomy" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1038/347066a0> dct:title "Polydactyly in the earliest known tetrapod limbs" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature03893> dct:title "The axial skeleton of the Devonian tetrapod Ichthyostega" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature04639> dct:title "A Devonian tetrapod-like fish and the evolution of the tetrapod body plan" .
